<title>UK: HYPO-BANK sets warrants on BayerHypo.</title>
<headline>HYPO-BANK sets warrants on BayerHypo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>HYPO-BANK says it has issued 20 million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A	  49.00 DEM   3.90 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B	  51.00 DEM   3.30 DEM</p>
<p> PUT C	   43.00 DEM   4.10 DEM</p>
<p> PUT D	   45.00 DEM   5.10 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.DEC.96-15.DEC.98   PAYDATE	17.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT AND MUNICH  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
